A physical system is built to generate data that represents the impedance properties of the antenna. The system generates training data from the calibration sources then switches to the antenna to generate test data where predictions can be made. In Sect. Calibrating the REACH receiver, a characterised internal source is used in place of the antenna and in Sect. Full chain simulation demonstrating sky-averaged 21-cmsignal recovery the antenna is simulated.

